{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/USAttyEssayli/status/2112563090239963576","id":"2112563090239963576","text":"This supports our claim that California has no safeguards to prevent noncitizens from voting. Anyone can register and vote under California law with no verification required. With ZERO cooperation from CA officials, we verified that at least 20,000 noncitizens are receiving ballots. The actual number is much higher.","raw_text":{"text":"This supports our claim that California has no safeguards to prevent noncitizens from voting. Anyone can register and vote under California law with no verification required. With ZERO cooperation from CA officials, we verified that at least 20,000 noncitizens are receiving ballots. The actual number is much higher.","display_text_range":[0,317],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"USAttyEssayli","url":"https://x.com/USAttyEssayli","id":"1914737178279862272","followers":90888,"following":123,"likes":601,"media_count":106,"name":"F.A. United States Attorney Bill Essayli","description":"Official account of Bill Essayli, First Assistant U.S. Attorney for the Central District of California. Privacy policy: http://justice.gov/doj/privacy-policy","raw_description":{"text":"Official account of Bill Essayli, First Assistant U.S. Attorney for the Central District of California. Privacy policy: https://t.co/JFEUpNXpzz","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[120,143],"original":"https://t.co/JFEUpNXpzz","replacement":"http://justice.gov/doj/privacy-policy","display":"justice.gov/doj/privacy-po…"}]},"location":"Los Angeles, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1914737178279862272/1745344602","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1914737861733023744/8N1CE0Cx_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Apr 22 17:46:47 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.justice.gov/usao-cdca","display_url":"justice.gov/usao-cdca"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"governme